---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label mono-font">// 01</span>
      <h2 class="section-title pixel-font">about_me</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-image-wrap">
        <div class="about-img-frame">
          <img src="/perfil_2.png" alt="Xplix coding" class="about-img" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-img-tag mono-font">
          <span class="blink-dot"></span> coding_mode.exe
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-content">
        <p class="about-text">
          Hola, soy <strong class="name-highlight">Xplix</strong> — desarrollador de mods para
          Minecraft con Fabric y fan del pixel art. Paso las noches frente al monitor creando
          experiencias jugables y muy divertidas.
        </p>
        <p class="about-text">
          Mi especialidad son los minijuegos: desde minesweeper competitivo hasta juegos de memoria
          con personalidad.
        </p>

        <div class="skills-grid">
          <div class="skill-item">
            <span class="skill-icon"></span>
            <div>
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Fabric API</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Mod development</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-item">
            <span class="skill-icon"></span>
            <div>
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Minigame Design</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Game mechanics</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-item">
            <span class="skill-icon"></span>
            <div>
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Java</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Primary language</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-item">
            <span class="skill-icon"></span>
            <div>
              <p class="skill-name mono-font">Pixel Art</p>
              <p class="skill-sub">Aesthetic enjoyer</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-tags">
          <span class="about-tag mono-font">squid_craft_fan</span>
          <span class="about-tag mono-font">lebiu_studio</span>
          <span class="about-tag mono-font">developer</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    color: var(--text);
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .section-title::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -8px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--purple), transparent);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-image-wrap {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-img-frame {
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 3px solid var(--border-purple);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--purple-dim);
    aspect-ratio: 1;
  }

  .about-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  .about-img-tag {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--green);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .blink-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--green);
    border-radius: 0;
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }

  .about-text {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .name-highlight {
    color: var(--purple-light);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .skill-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  .skill-item:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-purple);
    background: var(--bg-card-hover);
  }

  .skill-icon {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .skill-name {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .skill-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .about-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-tag {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--purple-dim);
    color: var(--purple-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-img-frame {
      max-width: 220px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
